    <h2>Quotes</h2>
    <p>Quotes are based on the information and files provided. Changes to requirements (material, quantity, deadlines, design changes) may affect price and lead time.</p>

    <h2>Quality</h2>
    <p>We carry out quality checks before dispatch. 3D printing is a manufacturing process and small visual artefacts may occur; we aim for clean, professional results appropriate to the selected process.</p>

    <h2>Design & files</h2>
    <p>Where design support is provided, it is quoted individually unless included as a minor adjustment within the print job. Customers are responsible for ensuring they have rights to reproduce any provided designs.</p>

    <h2>Delivery</h2>
    <p>Delivery options are discussed per project. Tracked shipping can be selected where needed.</p>

